す！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@6_xXx_x/works/79", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5f16b9bb/uploads/origins/87f983ea-d5f8-411e-acef-baadc997d5e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=684a917f578daaec305fc0207b18c482", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5f16b9bb/uploads/origins/87f983ea-d5f8-411e-acef-baadc997d5e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=684a917f578daaec305fc0207b18c482, https://si.imgix.net/5f16b9bb/uploads/origins/87f983ea-d5f8-411e-acef-baadc997d5e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=109d8fb60443b9da006b3561eef148a4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5f16b9bb/uploads/origins/87f983ea-d5f8-411e-acef-baadc997d5e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db1739282ec011bfcd4b97d4419032e2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "hello, your art is amazing! i would love to get a skeb of my character. she has horns and a tail, as well as scales on her face, arms, and legs. she also has freckles on her face. she is an academic who is very haughty, smug and flirty. she is a healer that uses a book and magic to protect those around her. i would love something that makes her look confident, but otherwise, i would like to leave everything up to you! please draw her in the second outfit, with the lace.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1wped6oM6DFTf8VuMWfIOBJHjVueX0af0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@6_xXx_x/works/78", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2fdce93f/uploads/origins/a41f2828-87b1-48a8-bcfa-a73acab7ab60?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee6d0aedb0221d667a17156c7f14fbda", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2fdce93f/uploads/origins/a41f2828-87b1-48a8-bcfa-a73acab7ab60?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee6d0aedb0221d667a17156c7f14fbda, https://si.imgix.ne